    "AI" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 只會看到路徑、名稱、大小、日期與項目數量，絕不會看到檔案內容。回答僅供參考，Ringwise 不會自動刪除任何東西。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI only sees paths, names, sizes, dates and item counts — never file contents. Answers are suggestions only; Ringwise never deletes anything automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 只会看到路径、名称、大小、日期和项目数量，绝不会看到文件内容。回答仅供参考，Ringwise 不会自动删除任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 小幫手（選用）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI Assistant (Optional)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 小助手（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 工具" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI Tool"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 工具回報錯誤：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI tool reported an error: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 工具报告错误：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 工具回報錯誤：沒有任何輸出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI tool reported an error: no output"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 工具报告错误：没有任何输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 工具回報錯誤：結束代碼 %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI tool reported an error: exit code %lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 工具报告错误：退出代码 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 的回答僅供參考，可能有誤。Ringwise 不會自動刪除任何檔案。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI answers are for reference only and may be wrong. Ringwise never deletes files automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 的回答仅供参考，可能有误。Ringwise 不会自动删除任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 的回答只是建議，Ringwise 不會自動刪除任何東西" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI answers are only suggestions — Ringwise never deletes anything automatically"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 的回答只是建议，Ringwise 不会自动删除任何东西"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 的回答只是建議，可能有錯。Ringwise 絕不會自動刪除任何東西，要不要刪除永遠由你決定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI answers are only suggestions and may be wrong. Ringwise never deletes anything automatically — what to delete is always your call."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 的回答只是建议，可能有错。Ringwise 绝不会自动删除任何东西，是否删除永远由你决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
