      }
    },
    "這些資料夾的大小沒有計入。多半是因為缺少「完整磁碟取用權限」，或是受 macOS 保護的系統資料夾。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sizes of these folders aren’t included. Usually Full Disk Access is missing, or they are system folders protected by macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些文件夹的大小没有计入。多半是因为缺少“完全磁盘访问权限”，或是受 macOS 保护的系统文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這些資料夾的識別碼不屬於任何已安裝的 App，也不是 Apple 系統元件。Ringwise 判斷得很保守，但仍請確認不再需要後再丟到垃圾桶。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These folders’ identifiers don’t belong to any installed app or Apple system component. Ringwise judges conservatively, but make sure you no longer need them before moving them to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些文件夹的标识符不属于任何已安装的应用，也不是 Apple 系统组件。Ringwise 的判断很保守，但仍请确认不再需要后再移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這些資料會傳給 %@ 處理，並適用 %@ 的隱私權政策。Ringwise 本身不會把任何資料傳到網路上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This data is sent to %1$@ for processing under %2$@’s privacy policy. Ringwise itself sends nothing over the network."
